XCLAW-77 fix. Memory hooks completely rewritten to eliminate tool exposure. Previously: sent sub-agent request through harness with all 59 MCP tools available, relied on 'Do NOT use other tools' instruction. Now: all memory operations (search, save, delete) happen in Rust via MemoryManager. LLM is only used for text synthesis/analysis — no tools exposed. Recall: search_text in Rust → format results → LLM synthesizes narrative. Remember: LLM analyzes exchange → outputs 'SAVE: ' lines → parsed and saved in Rust. Consolidate: list inbox → LLM outputs KEEP/DELETE lines → executed in Rust. Also fixed dispatcher to pass task.description (user's query) instead of ctx.current_prompt (full system+task prompt) to recall.
